request_counters.description:
Supported integrations are discovered on first install and checked again every 10 seconds. New counters appear within one minute. This counts observed HTTP requests from this Home Assistant instance, including redirects and retries. Provider quota and billable usage are not inferred. Startup and reload requests may be missed; counts are labelled as partial days and reset at 00:00 UTC.

{coverage}

For other integrations, connect an existing request sensor or ask its author to expose an owned HTTP session. Automatic cutoff stays off until you explicitly enable it.

